abstract: >
  High-performance Voronoi mesh generator for hydrodynamic and scientific modeling.
  Features C++20 concepts, DOD layout, CGAL backend isolation, bilingual errors,
  and multi-format export. Designed for integration with Mohid-NG and HPC solvers.
